            "cutId": "cut-03",
            "order": 1,
            "speakerName": "水野 澪",
            "speakerId": "speaker-9cdd4901f7",
            "text": "その言い方、昔と変わらないね。蓮",
            "bubbleId": "bubble-cut-03-u01",
            "preset": "dialogue"
          },
          {
            "id": "cut-03-u02",
            "cutId": "cut-03",
            "order": 2,
            "speakerName": "高瀬 蓮",
            "speakerId": "speaker-f97fa33a62",
            "text": "澪なのか？　東京にいるはずじゃ……",
